{"version":1,"content":"<p>【23：09更新】上午10時許，香港仔石排灣道100A號發生工業意外。</p><p>現場為香港仔漁業及海事分署，警方接報有吊臂撞及建築物外牆，兩男女受傷，其中男子一度昏迷。</p><p>救援人員到場，62歲男傷者回復知覺，半昏迷送往瑪麗醫院，57歲女傷者清醒同送院。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:23.532563+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:03:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:20:20.106481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:23.532563+00:00","content_hash":"0b1953203297a7c8793f24690aa4f927e49c2ee414ba415ccf821d137bc9adc5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}